# Architecture

`AGENTS.md` is the source of truth for this repo — read it before substantive changes.

Quick guardrails (details in `AGENTS.md`):

- Two tiers: **module library** (`modules/{nixos,darwin,home-manager}/` — features at top level, role presets in `bundles/`, register `flake.modules.<class>.<camelName>`) → **host wiring** (`modules/hosts/<host>/default.nix` selects modules + sets `my.*`).
- `import-tree` auto-loads `modules/**/*.nix` (skips `/_` paths); never add a manual import list to `flake.nix`.
- Hosts select modules via `my.*` + `homeImports`. Features may be reusable or single-host; don't branch on host identity inside a feature.
- Secrets: `secrets.nix` rule + `secrets/<name>.age` + an `age.secrets` reference. Never commit plaintext.
